;
; drivers-side-plate.ngc - mill the driver's side fixture plate.
;
; Copyright (C) 2026 narrativecollapse.  Free software under the WTFPL,
; version 2, with no warranty: see LICENSE.
;
; The plate is described in chapter 14 of "Machining the AR15 Lower
; Receiver Forging" by Ray Brandes.  Its reliefs clear the bumps on the
; driver's side of the forging.
;
; Stock: 6.000 x 2.500 x 0.500 aluminium, faced (facemill-plate.ngc), in
; the vise with at least 0.313 above the jaws.
;
; Datums: X0 Y0 at the plate's top left corner, so it runs to X6.000
; Y-2.500.  Z0 on its top surface.
;


; -- settings ---------------------------------------------------------

#<clear_z> = 0.100

#<tool> = 1             ; 0.250 end mill
#<tool_dia> = 0.250
#<rpm> = 2000
#<feed> = 5

#<stepover> = [#<tool_dia> / 2]
#<step_down> = 0.125
#<finish> = 0.010

#<thin_z> = -0.106      ; the large thinned area
#<slot_z> = -0.313      ; the two slots in the thinned area
#<left_slot_z> = -0.125


; -- program ----------------------------------------------------------

o<ar15-start> call [#<clear_z>]
o<ar15-tool> call [#<tool>] [#<rpm>] [#<feed>] [#<tool_dia>]

; The large thinned area: X2.750 to the right end, the whole width.  It
; plunges off the top edge.
o<ar15-pocket> call [6.000 + #<tool_dia> / 2] [#<tool_dia> * 1.5] [2.750] [-2.500 - #<tool_dia> * 1.5] [0] [#<thin_z>] [#<tool_dia>] [#<stepover>] [#<step_down>] [#<finish>]

; The right slot, X3.750 to X4.500, the whole width.  It plunges off the
; bottom edge.
o<ar15-pocket> call [3.750] [-2.500 - #<tool_dia> * 1.5] [4.500] [#<tool_dia> * 1.5] [#<thin_z>] [#<slot_z>] [#<tool_dia>] [#<stepover>] [#<step_down>] [#<finish>]

; The small slot at the top, from the thinned area's wall at X2.750.
; NOTE: the original program put the cutter's centre, not its edge, at
; X3.438 Y-0.500 here, unlike every other pocket, so this slot came out
; to X3.563 Y-0.625.  Those are the walls kept here.  Check them against
; the book's drawing; if the drawing says 3.438 and 0.500, use those.
o<ar15-pocket> call [2.750] [#<tool_dia> * 1.5] [3.563] [-0.625] [#<thin_z>] [#<slot_z>] [#<tool_dia>] [#<stepover>] [#<step_down>] [#<finish>]

; The slot on the left: 0.376 wide, centred on Y-0.594, from the left
; edge to X1.563.  It plunges off the left edge and cuts along X.
o<ar15-pocket> call [-#<tool_dia> * 1.5] [-0.594 + 0.188] [1.375 + 0.188] [-0.594 - 0.188] [0] [#<left_slot_z>] [#<tool_dia>] [#<stepover>] [#<step_down>] [#<finish>]

o<ar15-end> call
m2
